<title>CANADA: Antares president, CEO resigns.</title>
<headline>Antares president, CEO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Antares Mining and Exploration Corp said on Tuesday that Anthony de Werth has resigned as president, chief executive officer and director.</p>
<p>&quot;Mr. de Werth's resignation provides him with the necessary time to pursue other business and personal interests,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Dennis Gray, the company's chairman and technical director, will replace de Werth until a successor is appointed, Antares said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100))</p>
